# Athletica product detail UI patch

Apply from the Athletica repository root with `git apply ATHLETICA-PRODUCT-DETAIL-UI.patch`.

This patch replaces only the product detail page client component and imports the existing `rollout1-pixel-match.css` stylesheet from its route page. It does not modify admin screens, `/admin/signin`, APIs, database code, Sanity integrations, or other routes. The stylesheet already exists in the current `main` branch.

